            assertTrue(seen.add(op.a()), "duplicate node id " + op.a());
        }
    }
}
```
This checks CREATE_NODE ids. Good enough for the frame invariant.

Test 1: snapshot with shared subtree, assert unique ids. Build:
```java
View shared = VStack.children(Text.make(t -> t.text("shared")), Button.make(...));
View wide = HStack.children(shared, Text.make(t -> t.text("wide")));
View compact = HStack.children(shared, Text.make(t -> t.text("compact")));
